Package: CDMr
Type: Package
Title: Community Distribution Modelling in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Alex", family = "Ryabov", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "alexey.ryabov@uol.de")
    )
Description: Tools for Community Distribution Modelling. Community
    composition data are embedded in a low-dimensional space with diffusion
    maps, samples are clustered into community types, and community types are
    characterized by their taxonomic composition. Support vector machines and
    random forests predict community-type probabilities from environmental
    conditions; predictor selection, tuning, and class balancing are
    evaluated with nested, blocked, stratified cross-validation.
